{"id":"639805","name":"蜂蜜烤栗子","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/639805/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"栗子","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"一勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将栗子清洗干净。","img":"images/639805/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"在栗子上切出十字刀，尽量开长一点。","img":"images/639805/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将清水，白糖，栗子放入锅中煮20分钟。","img":"images/639805/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮好沥干水份。","img":"images/639805/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入食用油搅拌均匀后摆入空气炸锅内，180度烤10分钟。","img":"images/639805/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再给所有栗子刷上蜂蜜再烤5分钟。","img":"images/639805/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"烤好。","img":"images/639805/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"香甜软糯，易脱壳，好吃不腻。","img":"images/639805/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：空气炸锅、烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}